From 26ec1f2f2b09e660bdbf92e00d13103b57c138fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex <alexsbryan@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:35:35 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] instrument: name the form of each failure in closed sets
 the site passes

Production telemetry shows 8 of 30 notes not going through, in three groups:
- ValueError at notes.py:23 (strptime) on 3 inputs
- AttributeError at clients.py:10 (plan_id.upper) on 2 inputs
- 422 from the clearinghouse on 3 inputs
Their messages and bodies arrive only as shapes, so the why is not visible.

This candidate observes only: each new attribute is a member of a set
declared in recipe.json telemetry.attributes (observe.py), so it can pass
as written. Same exceptions, same outcomes.
